      en: ["The total length of the Tamsui River system is approximately 158 kilometers.", "It is one of the few rivers in Taiwan that is partially navigable by large vessels.", "The Tamsui Mangrove Conservation Area covers about 76 hectares of land.", "Tamsui Port was officially opened to foreign trade in 1862.", "The Guandu Bridge is a prominent red-arch landmark crossing the river.", "The river's drainage basin is home to over 7 million people."],
      es: ["La longitud es de 159 km.", "La cuenca cubre 2726 km².", "El ancho promedio en el curso inferior es de 300 m.", "El río nace a unos 1000 m de altura.", "El estuario es un humedal de 100 hectáreas.", "El rango de marea máximo es de 3,5 m."],
      pt: ["O comprimento é de 159 km.", "A bacia abrange 2726 km².", "A largura média no curso inferior é de 300 m.", "O rio nasce a cerca de 1000 m de altitude.", "O estuário é uma zona úmida de 100 hectares.", "A amplitude máxima da maré é de 3,5 m."],
      fr: ["La longueur est de 159 km.", "Le bassin versant couvre 2726 km².", "La largeur moyenne dans le cours inférieur est de 300 m.", "La rivière prend sa source à environ 1000 m d'altitude.", "L'estuaire est une zone humide de 100 hectares.", "L'amplitude maximale des marées est de 3,5 m."],
