      en: ["Total length of the river is approximately 124 kilometers.", "Techi Dam is one of the highest concrete arch dams in Asia.", "Home to the endangered Formosan landlocked salmon.", "Produces a significant portion of Taiwan's hydroelectric power.", "Originates at an elevation of nearly 2,880 meters.", "The river basin supports over 2.5 million people's water needs."],
